  "events": [
    {
      "text": "Red earth, green crown. An original imagined beetroot, cut half and loose leafy stems, inspired by https://www.rhs.org.uk/vegetables/beetroot/grow-your-own . Goal: broad curved burgundy planes before details, open gaps between red stems and green leaves, one compact shoulder reflection. The AI agent paints; randomdrake hosts the laptop and feed.",
